  m_text: Rujak Kuah Pindang is a legendary and beloved Balinese street food delicacy
    that offers an unconventional yet exceptionally refreshing twist on traditional
    fruit salads. It masterfully combines a vibrant assortment of fresh, crisp tropical
    fruits with a savory, fish-based broth derived from boiled pindang stock. This
    distinct flavor profile relies on a meticulous blend of fiery bird's eye chilies,
    roasted shrimp paste, salt, and rich fish broth, creating an immediate explosion
    of sour, sweet, spicy, and savory notes on the palate.
